  <item>
    <title>2. Girl&apos;s talk：走过好几个城市，搞钱还得看深圳</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66fb92cb81cdab3a9349c323</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66fb92cb81cdab3a9349c323</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 01 Oct 2024 06:12:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目是跟《新深圳女孩》联合制作~感谢3个小仙女噢~</span></p><span></span><p><span>👇本期播客详细引路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">01:42</a> 粤语版开头，听得人麻酥酥，墙裂建议不要跳过哦🥹</span></p><span></span><p><span>【一段很牛逼的自我介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="242">04:02</a> 布布：初中起开始从老家四川，不断向东边“迁移”的女人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="386">06:26</a> 大包：“不速之客”竟是资深深圳女孩，从幼儿园起就生活在深圳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="693">11:33</a> 米蓝达：被告知明天就去北京读书的湖南女孩，随夫来到深圳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="916">15:16</a> 唯欣：在牛肉火锅之乡长大，20 多岁为了结束异地恋来到深圳</span></p><span></span><p><span>【深圳的搞钱氛围，一人一词】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1224">20:24</a> 开放：喝几杯才开口？不需要！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1406">23:26</a> 效率：时间就是金钱，效率就是生命，这话不虚！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1454">24:14</a> 根植于血脉：玩着玩着就把钱赚了😎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1637">27:17</a> 真诚：“交到朋友了”，不是一上来卖保险的朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span>【不同城市搞钱氛围对比】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1731">28:51</a> 都说潮汕人爱搞钱，为什么天天看见他们在喝茶？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1819">30:19</a> 四川公认地爱打麻将！要的就是巴适～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1949">32:29</a> 为啥说海南男人都是蛀米虫？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2061">34:21</a> 深圳搞钱的人从来都不是同一波</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2264">37:44</a> 北京搞钱的都不是本地人，不同区的搞钱浓度还不一样！？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【自由职业 VS 打工状态、搞钱观对比】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2628">43:48</a> 停一停挺好的，搞钱重要，如何可持续、花得精彩也重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2995">49:55</a> 北京国企，恐怕是我们都想进的单位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3076">51:16</a> 大包：离职不到一个月，很慌，还有工作后遗症</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3258">54:18</a> 米蓝达：即便自由职业快2年，还会有很多不安感，每天总得愁点啥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3578">59:38</a> 唯欣：自由职业后，对老板的戾气消失了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3791">01:03:11</a> 布布：我的自洽源于不同体验的新鲜感，“我的体验是另一种时薪”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3920">01:05:20</a> “什么叫自由职业？只要你今晚去酒吧打工，赚到100块就开始了自由职业。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4014">01:06:54</a> 大部分人的处境：不是想休就休，而是得做好一切准备才「敢休息」</span></p><span></span><p><span>【不同阶段的搞钱方法、搞钱观】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4170">01:09:30</a> 布布：自由职业者和品牌主到底在卖什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4445">01:14:05</a> 如何拥有被动收入？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4529">01:15:29</a> 大包：你赚多少钱，很可能与你建立金钱观的时间有关</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4892">01:21:32</a> 赚钱靠机缘巧合、靠本事、靠环境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5116">01:25:16</a> 搞钱女孩开挂的三种心态：我是公主→我是反派→我是你爹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5281">01:28:01</a> “自由职业是创业前的 landing 期”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5423">01:30:23</a> 赚钱 3 阶段：自由职业→个人ip→成为平台赋能他人</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkxz2aihsjnlOjW4RypqNyWd_H7n.m4a" length="158203643" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:49:04</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsQyUwYN1iqWyDjkLon4r2yiwnVT.png"/>
